URL: https://www.mdfs.it/
Description: Functions for MultiDimensional Feature Selection (MDFS):
        calculating multidimensional information gains, scoring
        variables, finding important variables, plotting selection
        results. This package includes an optional CUDA implementation
        that speeds up information gain calculation using NVIDIA
        GPGPUs. R. Piliszek et al. (2019) <doi:10.32614/RJ-2019-019>.
